OL,4,CFury reveals schizophrenia diagnosis   
OL,5,GTyson Fury says he was diagnosed with  
OL,6,Gschizophrenia soon after his world     
OL,7,Gtitle win over Wladimir Klitschko in   
OL,8,G2015.                                  
OL,10,FBritish heavyweight Fury, 38, says he  
OL,11,Fheard voices in his head threatening   
OL,12,Fto hurt him and his family.            
OL,14,FIn a documentary which will be         
OL,15,Freleased by Netflix on Friday, Fury    
OL,16,Fand wife Paris describe how he was     
OL,17,Fdiagnosed after being admitted to      
OL,18,Fhospital with a suspected heart attack 
OL,19,Fin June 2016.                          
OL,21,F"Words can't explain the darkness I    
OL,22,Fwas in," Fury says.                    
